{"id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-equation.md","title":"Equation","display":"df-equation — Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-equation","aliases":["93-df-equation"],"display":"df-equation — Equation","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-equation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equation — Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(T_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span> is the term set of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\\)</span> are the equation set and its two-term predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq T_{\\tau}(X)\\times T_{\\tau}(X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq T_{\\tau}(X)\\times T_{\\tau}(X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An equation is a syntactic ordered pair of terms indexed by the complete similarity type. Its satisfaction by an algebra is a separate semantic relation quantified over valuations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, and $T_{\\tau}(X)$ is the term set of [[93-df-term]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\coloneqq T_{\\tau}(X)\\times T_{\\tau}(X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1143,"backlinks":[{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)$ is the equation set of [[93-df-equation]]."},{"id":"c8026e52a7730811","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}$ and $\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}$ are sourced from [[93-df-equation]] and [[93-df-equational-class]]."},{"id":"d57b5a54109bb025","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"93fe0da744c955c6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ is the equation set sourced through [[93-df-equation]]."},{"id":"343763670aeca8e0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerp